      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
        Jangan Biarkan Rencana Liburan Hanya Wacana.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-200 text-base sm:text-lg mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Beri tahu kami jumlah rombongan dan destinasi impian Anda. Tim NUSA akan merancang proposal penawaran terbaik dalam <strong>1x24 Jam</strong>.
      </p>

      <!-- Giant WhatsApp CTA Button -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <button onclick="triggerWA('Final CTA - Hubungi Tim NUSA Sekarang')" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-nusa-dark font-extrabold px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-emerald-500/25 transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-base sm:text-lg">
